    {
      "id": "claim_1a89444c2e6c4c13858f4d31797f2302",
      "statement": "The create_agent function provides three overloaded signatures for type-safe agent construction: one for no structured output (ResponseT=Any), one for raw dict schemas (ResponseT=dict[str, Any]), and one for typed schemas with proper type inference. It constructs a compiled LangGraph state machine orchestrating conversation flow between model, tools, and middleware while automatically handling tool binding, structured output strategy selection, state schema resolution, and middleware composition.",
